器环境","evidenceRequired":["Chrome DevTools Performance 性能面板记录分析文件","控制台自动化基准测试脚本运行耗时日志截图与数据文本","全量 JSON 导出与覆盖导入前后数据 MD5 一致性核对报告"],"exclusions":"排除服务端性能测试（无后端架构），排除网络往返延迟（纯本地离线持久化）","failureBehavior":"若实测检索响应时间超过 250ms，触发长列表虚拟滚动（Virtual Scroll）优化与前缀索引重构；若配额异常未捕获，加固存储事务失败监听并降级使用 LocalStorage 草稿应急保护","goal":"在真实宿主浏览器中实测验证 IndexedDB (Dexie.js) 本地持久化稳定性、1,000 条便签基准下的全文模糊检索端到端延迟（含 80ms 防抖）及存储配额满载告警与状态保留机制。","modules":["StorageService","SearchEngine","BackupManager","WorkspaceUI"],"normalBehavior":"批量注入 1,000 条便签耗时 \u003c 800ms；键入检索词后，包含 80ms 防抖整体端到端 UI 渲染完成延迟稳定在 150ms 以内；全量导出 1,000 条便签生成的 JSON 文件校验无损耗；首屏冷启动 TTI \u003c 1.0s。","onFailure":"若性能未达标，将检索算法升级为基于内存倒排索引或 Trie 树索引，并引入分页虚拟滚动；若配额异常处理失败，补齐跨标签页存储状态同步与本地草稿自动暂存机制。","passCriteria":["10 次复合关键词搜索平均端到端延迟 \u003c= 150ms","批量写入 1,000 条数据无丢损，导出并重新导入后条目数与字段校验一致性达 100%","配额超限异常注入时，输入框及编辑弹窗内文本 100% 完整保留未丢失"],"scope":"覆盖 Chrome、Edge、Firefox 真实浏览器；利用测试脚本自动批量注入 1,000 条便签样本集（涵盖单行、多行、代码块、丰富标签）；执行全文检索、动态高亮、JSON 导出与导入合并全链路性能及稳定性检验。","steps":["1. 运行构建命令并在真实 Chrome 浏览器中启动本地预览页面","2. 在浏览器控制台执行基准数据灌入脚本，批量生成 1,000 条混合格式便签并写入 IndexedDB","3. 开启 Performance 性能分析，输入 10 组包含中文、英文、符号及 #标签 的查询词，记录从击键到界面渲染完成的时间差","4. 触发全量 JSON 导出，检验生成文件哈希与便签结构，随后执行增量合并导入比对一致性","5. 模拟存储配额满状态，执行便签提交，验证错误横幅展示与输入框内容保留情况"],"verification":["使用 Chrome DevTools Performance 面板测量键盘事件至重新排版完成的真实时间戳","调用 StorageManager.estimate() 校验配额估算与超限拦截流程","通过测试脚本核对导入导出便签集合的双向深度相等（Deep Equal）"]},"title":"宿主浏览器端持久化容量与全文检索性能实测验证任务"}],"decisions":[{"area":"frontend_architecture","decisionKey":"technical.frontend_framework","evidenceIds":["evidence-react-official","evidence-vite-official","evidence-typescript"],"rationale":"根据已确认的产品形态决策（dec-0b4e5bce-aff8-45b1-8491-8edf7c4b150d），技术选型聚焦现代化轻量单页架构。React 19 提供卓越的声明式组件生态与状态更新模型，结合 Vite 极速的本地 HMR 与高度优化的纯静态打包能力，输出零服务端运行时依赖的前端产物。","statement":"采用 React 19 + TypeScript 5.x + Vite 现代化工程架构作为轻量 Web 单页应用的核心开发基座。"},{"area":"storage_architecture","decisionKey":"technical.storage_baseline","evidenceIds":["evidence-indexeddb-spec","evidence-mdn-indexeddb","evidence-storage-estimate"],"rationale":"IndexedDB 原生支持大容量结构化数据存储与事务回滚，彻底规避 LocalStorage 的 5MB 配额限制与同步阻塞问题。结合已确认的 Dexie.js 封装库（dec-22c4d85c-5b93-4fe2-846c-b47a8a67fbca）与 StorageManager.estimate()，兼具响应式查询（useLiveQuery）与配额预警保护能力。","statement":"以浏览器原生 IndexedDB 作为本地数据唯一持久化存储介质，采用已确认决策 dec-22c4d85c-5b93-4fe2-846c-b47a8a67fbca 的 Dexie.js 响应式封装库管理对象仓库、强类型 Schema 与复合索引，辅以 StorageManager API 进行配额与用量感知。"},{"area":"data_portability","decisionKey":"technical.backup_format_and_verification","evidenceIds":["evidence-file-api","evidence-indexeddb-spec"],"rationale":"精准落地已确认决策 dec-b17f49d8-86c3-4a74-baee-856b5d753129，确保在无服务器环境下数据完全由用户自主掌控，兼具导入格式严密校验与轻量温和提醒。","statement":"采用标准 JSON Schema v1 导出与强校验规范，结合 W3C File API（Blob 与 FileReader）实现纯客户端无后端依赖的导入导出，并在持久化元数据中维护 unbackedChangesCount 与 lastBackupAt 驱动温和防丢提醒。"},{"area":"markdown_rendering","decisionKey":"technical.markdown_engine","evidenceIds":["evidence-react-official"],"rationale":"用户已明确委托 AI 拟定 Markdown 解析策略。marked 具有极高的编译性能与仅约 7KB 的超轻量体积，配合工业级 DOMPurify 白名单过滤能够有效防范恶意脚本注入（XSS），并能轻松支持 GitHub Flavored Markdown (GFM) 任务清单复选框交互与代码块高亮，兼顾极速首屏体验与严格的数据安全。","statement":"采用 marked + DOMPurify 轻量安全组合作为便签详情与预览的 Markdown 编译与 XSS 消毒方案，配合 Prism.js 实现代码语法高亮。"}],"dependsOn":[],"id":"group-technical-architecture-design","impact":"确定基于 React 19、TypeScript、Vite 与 IndexedDB (Dexie.js) 的纯前端单页架构，定义系统模块职责边界、数据实体模型、服务契约、错误恢复策略及静态构建部署标准，建立宿主浏览器基准验证任务。","rejectDecisionIds":[],"removeBlockIds":[],"status":"pending","title":"随手灵感工具技术架构设计与规格规范"}],"questions":[],"summary":"依据已批准的产品蓝图与用户决策（包括已确认的 Dexie.js 持久化驱动 dec-22c4d85c 与委托 AI 拟定的 Markdown 解析方案），彻底解决了已批准证据不可变记录冲突（INVALID_EVIDENCE）问题：遵循“引用已批准证据直接使用原 ID、不必在 evidence 数组重复输出”的规划准则，在 evidence 数组中移除了既有产品阶段证据，仅保留本阶段通过 research_read 真实查证的 8 条权威官方证据（覆盖 React 19、Vite、W3C IndexedDB 3.0、MDN StorageManager 与 File API、TypeScript）以及 1 条记录 Docker 沙盒未启动的受控环境证据。生成了涵盖 technology、module、data_model、interface、error、deployment 及 validation 的完整自洽技术设计包，详细规定了 Dexie.js 响应式状态流、纯前端模糊检索、数据模型实体、接口契约、输入草稿绝对保留与降级恢复策略，并将 1,000 条便签性能指标明确作为待验证目标移交交付阶段的真实浏览器环境实测。","toolAction":"Submitting technical revision","toolSummary":"Technical architecture revision"}
","duration_seconds":224.360898,"num_turns":1,"structured_output":{"blockers":[],"clarification":null,"evidence":[{"applicability":"前端核心视图层框架与组件化状态驱动技术依据","content":"React v19.3 The library for web and native user interfaces. Create user interfaces from components. React components receive data and return what should appear on the screen.","hash":"e56a65d65c8b4f9115e45db799de1554e4f38ef965169ecc4d235d0601b341e7","id":"evidence-react-official","kind":"official-source","location":"https://react.dev/","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:54:35.248Z","source":"https://react.dev/"},{"applicability":"现代前端轻量单页构建与零服务端静态部署规范依据","content":"Vite is a blazing fast frontend build tool powering the next generation of web applications. Instant Server Start, Lightning Fast HMR, Rich Features Out of the Box, Optimized Build powered by Rolldown.","hash":"04797a62b5b7e1b71ca542a734ee9196e33473412e97f205ae9986c004ab9764","id":"evidence-vite-official","kind":"official-source","location":"https://vite.dev/","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:55:11.017Z","source":"https://vite.dev/"},{"applicability":"客户端本地持久化存储、主键索引与事务回滚的核心规范依据","content":"Indexed Database API 3.0 W3C Working Draft. This document defines APIs for a database of records holding simple values and hierarchical objects. Each record consists of a key and some value. The database maintains indexes over records it stores. Transactions lifecycle, Object store storage operation, retrieval, clear.","hash":"c3a5c1e003fc2f7fa8d27ea2dc6b2e2e097b49aa81d8b138543c8725004e8536","id":"evidence-indexeddb-spec","kind":"official-source","location":"https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:55:18.439Z","source":"https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/"},{"applicability":"浏览器端本地持久化存储与事务保障技术选型依据","content":"IndexedDB is a low-level API for client-side storage of significant amounts of structured data, including files/blobs. This API uses indexes to enable high-performance searches of this data. IndexedDB is a JavaScript-based object-oriented database that supports transactions.","hash":"7c3f3a504f93e96a3872db9d63cf716267a09fa8e2618f0b4ef554e0416e9a78","id":"evidence-mdn-indexeddb","kind":"official-source","location":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IndexedDB_API","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:55:57.940Z","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IndexedDB_API"},{"applicability":"客户端离线运行与本地事务模式设计依据","content":"IndexedDB is a way to persistently store data inside a user's browser, enabling applications to work both online and offline. The pattern involves opening a database, creating an object store, starting transactions, and executing requests.","hash":"918e85e2b819f56bdbf566cb52d95940a593164dfe7898f38acdff41e36c6c87","id":"evidence-mdn-using-indexeddb","kind":"official-source","location":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IndexedDB_API/Using_IndexedDB","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:56:16.650Z","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IndexedDB_API/Using_IndexedDB"},{"applicability":"本地存储空间估算与配额超限预警技术实现依据","content":"The estimate() method of the StorageManager interface asks the Storage Manager for how much storage the current origin takes up (usage), and how much space is available (quota). Unit is byte.","hash":"35346bb4f2f91eab4ed505353267c21a4f0cf57896e95d2ae79a722dc80f3207","id":"evidence-storage-estimate","kind":"official-source","location":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/StorageManager/estimate","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:56:08.750Z","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/StorageManager/estimate"},{"applicability":"客户端无服务端依赖下的 JSON 备份导出（Blob 机制）与文件读取导入（FileReader）官方规范","content":"File API W3C Working Draft. A Blob interface, which represents immutable raw binary data. A File interface. A FileReader interface, which provides methods to read a File or a Blob, and an event model to obtain the results of these reads. A URL scheme for use with binary data such as files.","hash":"975b6f12f51320b7f90af2b97e38a80358b5964bc274caafb5d126b3f3881efc","id":"evidence-file-api","kind":"official-source","location":"https://www.w3.org/TR/FileAPI/","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:55:36.795Z","source":"https://www.w3.org/TR/FileAPI/"},{"applicability":"类型安全定义便签数据结构、导入导出格式强校验与编译期防错基石","content":"TypeScript: JavaScript With Syntax For Types. TypeScript adds additional syntax to JavaScript to support a tighter integration with your editor. Catch errors early in your editor. TypeScript code converts to JavaScript, which runs anywhere JavaScript runs: In a browser, on Node.js.","hash":"405cee3660db50249ce28e111779ed8613819653ebecfd91b621cd6eb8e4efcb","id":"evidence-typescript","kind":"official-source","location":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:55:47.336Z","source":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/"},{"applicability":"宿主 Docker 容器环境不可用记录，指引将性能基准与配额边界测试移交至开发前置验证任务","content":"Docker daemon connection failed (The system cannot find the file specified). Node.js container environment unavailable for automated runtime benchmarks.","environment":"node:24.13.0-bookworm-slim","id":"evidence-exp-docker-env-prep","kind":"experiment","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T15:54:40.000Z","outcome":"unexecuted","source":"experiment:prepare-eff1ef3a-50c0-4749-b41f-54de3acbb135"}],"followUp":[],"groups":[{"blocks":[{"content":"### 核心技术栈与架构基准
1. **视图层与状态管理**：
   - 核心框架：React 19 (19.3) 结合 TypeScript 5.x，全面采用函数式组件与自定义 Hook 架构（引用 React 官方文档 evidence-react-official 与 TypeScript 规范 evidence-typescript）。
   - 响应式状态流：采用 React 纯上下文与事件驱动模型（Context + Dexie.js useLiveQuery 响应式钩子），将 UI 状态与底层存储严格解耦，实现数据变更时的毫秒级视图自动刷新。
2. **构建与打包工具**：
   - 构建工具链：Vite（基于 Rolldown / Rollup 静态优化引擎，官方文档 evidence-vite-official）。
   - 核心特性：ESModule 开发服务器提供毫秒级热重载（HMR < 50ms）；生产环境输出极简纯静态资源包（HTML/JS/CSS），无任何 Node.js 运行时后端依赖。
3. **客户端数据库引擎**：
   - 依据已确认决策 dec-22c4d85c-5b93-4fe2-846c-b47a8a67fbca，基于浏览器原生 IndexedDB（引用 W3C evidence-indexeddb-spec 与 MDN evidence-mdn-indexeddb, evidence-mdn-using-indexeddb），采用 Dexie.js 响应式封装库声明强类型 Schema 与复合索引。
4. **样式与视觉体系**：
   - CSS 架构：Tailwind CSS，采用原子化 Utility-First 模式，构建期执行类名按需编译与 Tree-shaking，产物 CSS 压缩后预计小于 15KB，零运行时性能负担。
   - 图标集：Lucide React，按需动态引入 SVG 图标组件。
5. **运行环境要求与 Web API 依赖**：
   - 目标浏览器基线：Chrome/Edge >= 109, Firefox >= 115 (ESR), Safari >= 16.4，兼容主流现代移动浏览器（iOS Safari, Android Chrome）。
   - 关键宿主 Web API：
     - `IndexedDB API 2.0/3.0+`：事务级客户端持久化存储。
     - `StorageManager.estimate()`：实时查询当前 Origin 的 storage quota 与 usage（引用 MDN evidence-storage-estimate）。
     - `Clipboard API`（`navigator.clipboard.writeText`）：支持代码块一键复制，环境受限时降级为 `execCommand`。
     - `File API / Blob / URL.createObjectURL`：支持浏览器端纯本地 JSON/Markdown 备份生成与下载触发（引用 W3C evidence-file-api）。
6. **未验证试验与基线转移声明**：
   - 规划阶段由于宿主 Docker 守护进程未启动（引用 evidence-exp-docker-env-prep），自动化容器沙盒基准未能执行。所有性能数字（1,000 条便签下全文检索延迟 < 150ms、首屏冷启动 TTI < 1.0s）明确作为待验证目标，完整移入交付阶段在真实浏览器环境中进行实测验收。","dependsOn":["page-main-workspace","block-scope-core-boundaries"],"evidenceIds":["evidence-react-official","evidence-vite-official","evidence-typescript","evidence-exp-docker-env-prep"],"id":"tech-core-architecture","kind":"technology","requirementIds":["block-scope-core-boundaries","block-outcomes-lightweight-experience"],"stage":"technical","title":"纯前端轻量 Web 单页应用技术栈与运行环境规范"},{"content":"### 客户端持久化存储与模糊检索架构
1. **单一事实来源（Single Source of Truth）**：
   - 所有便签实体、标签聚合关系与备份元数据完全保存在浏览器 IndexedDB 数据库 `SparkNotesDB`（版本 1）中，彻底规避 LocalStorage 的 5MB 限制与同步阻塞问题。
   - 核心对象仓库（Object Store via Dexie.js）：
     - `notes`：主键 `id` (UUID 字符串)；索引：`updatedAt`、`createdAt`、`status`、`*tags`（多值 Multi-entry 索引）、`isPinned`、`isFavorite`。
     - `meta`：主键 `key` (字符串)，存放备份追踪器 `backup_tracker` 与用户偏好设置。
2. **纯前端全文检索与模糊匹配算法架构**：
   - 内存索引缓存：应用初始化加载时从 IndexedDB 异步读取有效便签列表放入内存状态；新增、修改、删除时通过 Dexie useLiveQuery 实时同步更新该内存镜像。
   - 检索防抖：输入框挂载 80ms 轻度防抖定时器，确保高频打字流畅无卡顿。
   - 匹配范围与分词：对正文文本、标签数组及日期文本执行不区分大小写的安全模糊匹配（支持空格多词分词逻辑与 `#` 标签精准匹配），命中内容动态生成带 `<mark class="highlight">` 的 Safe HTML 高亮节点。
   - 性能度量目标：在 1,000 条本地便签基准下，端到端检索过滤与 DOM 重排目标时间小于 150ms（含 80ms 防抖）。","dependsOn":["tech-core-architecture"],"evidenceIds":["evidence-indexeddb-spec","evidence-mdn-indexeddb","evidence-mdn-using-indexeddb","evidence-storage-estimate"],"id":"tech-storage-and-search","kind":"technology","requirementIds":["feature-quick-capture","feature-search-filter","feature-tag-organization"],"stage":"technical","title":"客户端持久化存储与模糊检索技术架构"},{"content":"### 模块划分与职责解耦设计
系统划分为高内聚、低耦合的六大核心服务与展现模块：

1. **存储驱动服务模块 (`StorageService`)**：
   - **职责**：基于 Dexie.js 封装 IndexedDB 数据库连接、版本升级、对象仓库 CRUD、事务原子性保证与 StorageManager 配额感知。
   - **边界**：纯数据访问层，不包含 UI 状态或特定业务逻辑；发生底层配额超限或数据库锁冲突时抛出强类型受控错误。
2. **便签领域业务模块 (`NoteService`)**：
   - **职责**：处理便签核心业务逻辑，包括便签提交校验、正文 `#标签` 智能提取、便签生命周期流转（置顶、加星收藏、归档、软删除与撤销）、标签全局批量重命名。
   - **边界**：协调 `StorageService` 进行事务写入，并在操作成功后向状态总线分发变更事件，同步递增未备份变更计数器。
3. **即时检索与高亮引擎 (`SearchEngine`)**：
   - **职责**：维护内存搜索索引缓存，执行带防抖的关键字分词、模糊匹配算法、多标签交集（AND）组合过滤，并生成关键词黄色高亮标记。
   - **边界**：纯计算无副作用模块，输入查询词与便签列表，输出过滤后便签及高亮位置元数据。
4. **备份管理与数据便携模块 (`BackupManager`)**：
   - **职责**：执行全量便签数据序列化打包与 JSON/Markdown 文件下载触发；解析并严格校验外部导入的备份文件 Schema；执行智能增量合并（基于 ID 与时间戳比对）或全量覆盖事务；维护 `lastBackupAt` 与 `unbackedChangesCount` 状态。
   - **边界**：保证导入导出的数据原子性，发生错误时自动回滚，不破坏现有本地数据。
5. **Markdown 安全解析与渲染模块 (`MarkdownRenderer`)**：
   - **职责**：采用 marked + DOMPurify 将纯文本便签内容编译为带结构的 HTML，集成白名单过滤防范 XSS，支持 GFM 任务清单复选框交互与 Prism.js 代码块语法高亮。
   - **边界**：提供可复用的渲染组件与工具函数，隔绝未经消毒的第三方字符串。
6. **主工作区交互与展现模块 (`WorkspaceUI`)**：
